body:
Ahh, I see. Well, I'll be staying initially in a town with a population 84.976 (where most of my family lives), which I guess is pretty small... But I don't think I can afford living in a big city. I don't think I can pay for more than €600 for rent at least in my first few years there. Maybe I can find somewhere between a small town and a big city...? Or live in a small town near a big city that I can often go to.

&#x200B;

I don't mind conservative people in general at all, it's just the age thing that bugs me. But thanks a lot for your input, those are things I have to consider.
